{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Show Guts</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Guts</strong> is a chaotic climbing game where you control a stretchy piece of <strong>omochi</strong> \u2014 yes, that soft Japanese rice cake \u2014 with\u00a0<strong>grappling</strong> and an unreasonable dream: reach the heavens before losing your guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, swing, and bounce your way through floating present boxes, skyscrapers , and torii gates.  <br>Every fall hurts, every rise feels glorious, and every splat echoes with\u2026 sticky determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stretch. Stick. Struggle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the chewy physics as your omochi clings to the impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall once, lose everything.</strong> <br>Precision and patience are your only ingredients for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aesthetics of absurdity.</strong> <br>Traditional Japanese vibes meet slapstick chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Year in the sky.</strong> <br>Chase the sunrise, find the ultimate <strong>Kagami-mochi</strong> at the top.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330020?t=1761482848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2330020?t=1761482848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330020/5e6934870f5a487834648110286edc6bdc05122c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761482848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330020/5e6934870f5a487834648110286edc6bdc05122c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761482848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Show Guts</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Guts</strong> is a chaotic climbing game where you control a stretchy piece of <strong>omochi</strong> \u2014 yes, that soft Japanese rice cake \u2014 with\u00a0<strong>grappling</strong> and an unreasonable dream: reach the heavens before losing your guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, swing, and bounce your way through floating present boxes, skyscrapers , and torii gates.  <br>Every fall hurts, every rise feels glorious, and every splat echoes with\u2026 sticky determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stretch. Stick. Struggle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the chewy physics as your omochi clings to the impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall once, lose everything.</strong> <br>Precision and patience are your only ingredients for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aesthetics of absurdity.</strong> <br>Traditional Japanese vibes meet slapstick chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Year in the sky.</strong> <br>Chase the sunrise, find the ultimate <strong>Kagami-mochi</strong> at the top.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DECA MAGIS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330020/b6fce8be0196aad6a398e255f8feda6675c0b3b3/header.jpg?t=1761482848","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2330020/781212213/233a8ec22fc8355869be0dbb62e2910e5